### VietPay — Transfer flows (wallet-service, JWT-protected)
### Run `login` first; requests read tokens/ids inline from prior responses.
### Transfer includes an optional `remark` (free-text note shown in the
### notification email to both parties). Idempotency-Key makes retries safe.

@baseUrl = http://localhost
@email = test2@vietpay.dev
@password = Password123!

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Create source wallet
# @name source
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currency": "USD" }

### Create destination wallet
# @name dest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currency": "USD" }

### Transfer $10.00 with an idempotency key + remark -> 201
# @name t1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceWalletId": "{{source.response.body.id}}",
  "destWalletId": "{{dest.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": "10.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "remark": "Rent for July"
}

### Retry SAME request with SAME key -> money moves ONCE (idempotent replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceWalletId": "{{source.response.body.id}}",
  "destWalletId": "{{dest.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": "10.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "remark": "Rent for July"
}

### Transfer without remark (remark is optional) -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceWalletId": "{{source.response.body.id}}",
  "destWalletId": "{{dest.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": "5.00",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Overdraw attempt -> 422 insufficient funds
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceWalletId": "{{source.response.body.id}}",
  "destWalletId": "{{dest.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": "999999.00",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Source wallet transaction history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/{{source.response.body.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Transfer detail by id -> 200 (only a participant may view; remark + timestamp)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers/{{t1.response.body.transferId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

